    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<div>Anything in English with English captions, e.g. movies, songs, audio books, novels, podcasts, etc.</div>\n",
    "tpc_book_en": "<div>Students are required to complete <strong>10 reading journals</strong> based on books, articles, films, TV series, songs, or other English&nbsp;materials they have read, watched, or listened to outside of class. Each journal must include <strong>at least 20 items</strong> learned (e.g., vocabulary, sentences, or idioms) and a <strong>50&ndash;80 word summary or reflection</strong>.</div>\n"
