  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "XA02101",
    "sub_id": "81184",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>閱讀: 30% 期中考: 30% 期末考: 30% 出席與課程參與: 10%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Reading Journal: 30% Midterm: 30% Final: 30% Attendance: 10%</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "Reading Journals: students are required to write 10 journals for the course. They must be hand-written, typed ones will not be accepted. \nGrading Principle: it's my principle to grade you openly and fairly. However, once your grade is finalized, I do not make changes for any individual.  \nAll the HW must be turned in on time.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.</div>\n\n<div>學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。<br />\n2. Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.</div>\n\n<div>抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。<br />\n3. Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.</div>\n\n<div>考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
